Handling.}{\langfe1040\rtlch \ltrch\loch\fs20\lang1033\loch\f7
 Speedgate XSD is very manageable, above all at low speed, thanks to good grip. Increasing the speed, the car replies quite well to steering inputs but at high speed (over 200 mph) it\u8217\'19s obviously not very easy to feel when the grip limit is reached and to correct in time (above all in NORH races) leading to eventual guide errors. }
